omlx — Apache License 2.0
Source: https://github.com/jundot/omlx, omlx/patches/qwen35_moe_router.py
(omlx_router_softmax_row; the integer key packing of omlx_router_topk) and
omlx/patches/qwen35_moe_routed_decode.py (the window and top-k fold designs).
mlx2_router_keys in src/mlx2/runtime/models/qwen4_moe_window.py follows
omlx_router_softmax_row closely; the selection, slot order, normalization and
all window kernels are mlx2's own (the window kernels are mlx2's one-token
routed-decode sources, provenance/omlx-routed-split-flash-next.json).
The full Apache-2.0 text is this repository's LICENSE.
